###api

# 1.ADMIN

### 1.1 Signup
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/auth/register-admin
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "confirmPassword": ""
}                                    

### 1.2 login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": ""
}

### 1.3 profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 1.4 forgot
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 1.5 admin-reset-password
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "password": "",
  "passwordConfirmation": ""
}


